  "contentPreview": "Task 4 correction: create-via-append now classifies a missing artifact as a create even when an orphan sidecar is indexed, captures raw before-images for both members, and restores the pre-existing sidecar byte-for-byte on failed publication. After both new members verify and the journal reaches Committed, JournalDelete failure is post-commit: the pair remains, the journal remains committed, and AppendAsync returns SuccessWithWarning/PostCommitCleanupFailed with the operation ID. Focused Append",
